  "operative_text": "Section 1 (Md. Code Ann., Education § 15-121(B)): NOTWITHSTANDING A PROVISION OF LAW, REGULATION, OR POLICY THAT PROHIBITS THE CARRYING OR POSSESSION OF A FIREARM ON THE CAMPUS OF A PUBLIC INSTITUTION OF HIGHER EDUCATION, A CONSERVATION ORGANIZATION MAY HOLD AN EVENT ON THE CAMPUS OF A PUBLIC INSTITUTION OF HIGHER EDUCATION REGARDLESS OF WHETHER MEMBERS OF THE ORGANIZATION CARRY OR POSSESS FIREARMS DURING THE EVENT."
